# Shared assemblage page

This page contains the platform-independent part of the example. The runnable
page [[transclusion_terminal]] transcludes these sections and supplies its own
Target.

## Schema

```
Game = Int/value
```

## Construction

```
[:Game 21]
```

## Methods

```
Game::double = { value + value }
```

## Target

```
%terminal

%main
public static function main():Void {
    var game = GameAssemblage.factory();
    trace(game.double());
}
```
